    <statement><p>Find the partial derivatives indicated.
Assume the variables are restricted to a domain on
which the function is defined.
<me>f(x,y) = x^{3}+4x^{5}y.</me></p>
<p><m>f_x(3,3) =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>f_y(3,3) =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4887</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
