        <m>972</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>f_x(x,y) = 3x^{2}+20x^{4}y\quad \mbox{  and  }\quad f_y(x,y)
    = 4x^{5},</me>
so
<me>f_x(3,3) = 4887\quad \mbox{  and  }\quad f_y(3,3) =
972.</me>




